# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Transit data and OTP build artifacts
#
# None of this belongs in git. Two reasons:
#
#  1. Size. graph.obj is ~490 MB and the OSM extract ~170 MB; GitHub rejects
#     any single file over 100 MB.
#  2. Licence. The TfC GTFS feeds are CC BY-NC 4.0. Committing them would make
#     this repository a redistribution of non-commercial data and pull those
#     terms over the whole tree. See OTP/README.md for where to fetch them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.osm.pbf
graph.obj
OTP/*.zip
OTP/*.bak
OTP/data/
otp-*.jar

# OTP's own config files (build-config.json, router-config.json,
# otp-config.json) are NOT ignored on purpose — they are small, they are how
# the graph build is configured, and they belong in version control.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env

# Flutter / Dart
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
*.iml
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
app/build/
app/.dart_tool/
app/.fvm/
app/.flutter-plugins*
app/ios/Pods/
app/ios/.symlinks/
app/android/.gradle/
app/android/local.properties
app/android/key.properties

# Release signing. `app/android/.gitignore` already covers these inside the
# Android tree; these two lines catch a keystore dropped anywhere else in the
# repository, which is how one actually gets committed by accident. The
# committed file is `app/android/key.properties.example`, which holds no
# secret - the real `key.properties` names a keystore and two passwords, and
# the signing key cannot be rotated once Play has seen it.
*.jks
*.keystore
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
app/lib/l10n/generated/

# app/pubspec.lock IS tracked on purpose - this is an application, not a
# library, and the whole point of a lock file is that two machines build the
# same bytes.

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Throwaway git worktrees created for background agents. Never committed -
# each is a full second checkout of this repository.
.claude/worktrees/
